      "claim": "The new date-override acceptance branch in checkIfIsAvailable treats an override as zero-length only when dayjs(date.start).add(utcOffset, 'minutes') === dayjs(date.end).add(utcOffset, 'minutes'). Because these are separate Dayjs instances, equal instants/dates do not compare true. A zero-length override that should be accepted as an exact match is instead skipped and falls through to working-hours/busy checks, misclassifying the slot.",
